WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.022
A higher temperature does not add knowledge or reasoning ability.

00:00:04.022 --> 00:00:07.927
It simply allows more variation during sampling.

00:00:07.927 --> 00:00:13.887
A lower temperature is more predictable, a higher temperature is more varied,

00:00:13.887 --> 00:00:18.272
and neither one changes the model's underlying capabilities.

00:00:18.272 --> 00:00:24.902
If a model does not know a fact, turning temperature up will not create reliable knowledge.

00:00:24.902 --> 00:00:27.715
It can simply create more varied guesses.
